>It's one of the most powerful things in the game, I collect as many as
>I can.  I've always wondered why monsters don't zap them at you.  It
>would make Nethack about 100% more difficult than it already is.

It is established in comments in the Nethack source code that inventory
should only be cancelled if the victim of the cancellation is cancelling
itself.  Hence, all that a monster would achieve by zapping you with a
wand of cancellation would be to rehumanize() you if you are not wearing
an amulet of unchanging.
